The paper develops a capacitive energy functional distinguishing Aharonov-Bohm and Coulomb-dominated interference regimes via the crossover parameter $\Delta = K_{IL}/K_I$, with $\Delta < 1/2$ favoring AB and $\Delta > 1/2$ favoring CD behavior.
